        "body": "## Security fixes\r\n\r\n- Remove external host exposure of Auth gRPC port 50051.\r\n- Require JWT signing and legal identity encryption secrets.\r\n- Bind access-token sessions to the JWT subject.\r\n- Disable local admin-header authentication bypass by default.\r\n- Update environment examples with secure defaults.\r\n- Add regression coverage for session/user mismatch during token validation.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- Auth token validation tests passed.\r\n- API Gateway admin auth guard tests passed.\r\n- Auth Service build passed.\r\n- API Gateway build passed.\r\n- Docker Compose config verified with no published Auth port.",
